 project examples for precision medicine  as a pre-clinical and clinical training  option  we will discuss how this pandemic gave  public awareness about the infectious  diseases  and what kinds of hands-on exercises  students can access  to learn about viral bacterial and  parasite-caused infections  using public domain data we will discuss  agriculture  the rise of technology driven precision  agrotechnology  with a focus on sustainable food supply  climate resistant strain breeding  and methods of bioinformatics analysis  that are in high demand  in this industry finally we will  introduce our new and planned  specializations like the field of  astrobiology  that is captivating the minds of  students who are seeing the commercial  space industry developing before their  eyes  this will be in addition to our existing  modules for which you will gain access  to the omixlogic portal  where you can try and explore these  modules exercises and pipeline building  coding and various methods of analysis  using project source from peer-reviewed  publications  importantly students are looking for  academic programs where they can  continue their studies  during the symposium our speakers will  share information about the programs  that they are associated with  and what their focus and differences are  as you consider to continue your  education  we will also bring together companies  that will share  what skills they are looking for and how  your experience  might make your resume stand out we also  will introduce  internship and fellowship programs for  those of you interested  to get your foot into the industry or  explore  different types of research  opportunities importantly we hope that  this symposium  will be the place where all levels of  bioinformatics  from data generation to data analysis  and integration  to decision making are going to be  addressed and  make bioinformatics training biology as  a data science  accessible to a larger number of  students  universities and companies  so if you would like to participate we  invite you to start your registration  you can opt for just an observer  or a participant to submit your poster  for  cash prizes and recognition from  a respected panel of judges and experts  that will take a look and evaluate every  poster that is being submitted
 

